    "aboutMe": "Hello 👋\n\nI'm a technology enthusiast, I love programming 💻.\n\nI'm a Game Developer at [Broken Arms Games](https://store.steampowered.com/developer/BrokenArmsGames)! 🍇⛳🏞️🕹️\n\nPreviously,\n\nI worked at Mario+Rabbids Sparks of Hope, Avatar: Frontiers of Pandora and Rocksmith+ at [Ubisoft Milan](https://www.ubisoft.com/it-it/) 🎮👾\n\nI used C++ and Unreal Engine to develop a BIM Software at [Zuru Tech Italy](https://zuru.tech/) 🏗🏠\n\nI developed Virtual Reality and Augmented Reality applications using C++ (proprietary engine) and Unity 3D for device like HTC Vive and Microsoft HoloLens at [Illogic](https://www.illogic.xyz/) 🚀.\n\nIn the free time I learn new technologies and develop video games at Game Jams, winning with my team the best game prize in the 2018 edition in Turin 🕹🥇.\n\nAll my projects are available on my [GitHub](https://github.com/andxet) 🧑‍💻.\n\nThe games I create are available in my [Itch.io page](https://andxet.itch.io/)! 🎮\n\nI also have a [blog](https://blog.andxet.dev) (only in __Italian__ for now)! 📝\n\nWith my drone I create 3D models of buildings around me. I publish all of them for free on [Sketchfab](https://sketchfab.com/andxet) 🏦.",
